{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-85958:  openssh security update (MODERATE)",
  "Description": "[9.9p1-13.0.1]\n- Restore pam_ssh_agent_rel values that were used for initial release\n- Fix PerSourcePenalties grace-exceeded using the crash penalty value [Orabug: 39825354]\n- Replace unsupported ML-KEM hybrid algorithm skip logic with v9.9p1-23.el10_2 ML-KEM/NIST backport [Orabug: 39423076]\n- Upstream references found with /usr/bin/ssh [Orabug: 37814929]\n\n[9.9p1-13]\n- CVE-2026-59998: Document caveat regarding GSSAPIStrictAcceptorCheck\n  Resolves: RHEL-276221\n- CVE-2026-59997: Fix internal-sftp server argument parsing limit\n  Resolves: RHEL-276234\n- CVE-2026-60000: Fix DoS via excessive GSSAPI authentication attempts\n  Resolves: RHEL-276230",
